{
    "title": "SCRUFF",
    "description": "SCRUFF is the top-rated and most reliable app for gay, bi, trans, and queer people to connect with each other.\r\n\r\nSCRUFF is an independent, LGBTQ+ owned and operated company, and we use the app that we build. We give users a private and secure experience, a friendly and diverse community, and more features than any other gay dating app. We\u2019re dedicated to protecting our members\u2019 data and improving user experience, so you\u2019ll never see banner ads on SCRUFF, and we won\u2019t sell your data to shady 3rd party companies.\r\n\r\n<b>MAKE REAL CONNECTIONS</b>\r\n\u2605 30+ million users, no spambots\r\n\u2605 Find exactly the people you like with search and filters\r\n\u2605 View, Woof, and chat with people from around the world\r\n\u2605 SCRUFF Match connects you with the people you like\r\n\u2605 Click \"I'm Interested\" on a profile and SCRUFF will let you know if there's a mutual attraction\r\n\r\n<b>EXPRESS YOURSELF</b>\r\n\u2605 Share your story with multiple profile pics, rich profiles, private albums, hashtags, and more\r\n\u2605 Let others know what you\u2019re into with profile details like your preferences\r\n\u2605 Comprehensive pronoun and gender identity options put you in control of your identity\r\n\r\n<b>A SMARTER, SAFER EXPERIENCE</b>\r\n\u2605 24/7 support for our community, including in-app links to our Safety Center\r\n\u2605 We never share your data with 3rd party ad networks or data aggregators like Google or Facebook\r\n\u2605 Message history, photos, and videos sync across your devices and never get lost\r\n\r\n<b>VERIFIED PROFILES</b>\r\n\u2605 Let others know you're real by verifying your profile photos\r\n\u2605 Complete the process in seconds and receive a verification badge on your profile\r\n\u2605 Know whose photos are real by looking for the badge on other profiles\r\n\r\n<b>VIDEO CHAT</b>\r\n\u2605 A fun and sexy way to get to know each other before you meet\r\n\u2605 Prefer to keep it virtual? Video chat has you covered\r\n\r\n<b>MATCH</b>\r\n\u2605 Every day, SCRUFF Match shows you a new stack of profiles who are looking for people like you\r\n\u2605 Swipe left to pass, right if you\u2019re interested - if it\u2019s a match, we\u2019ll let you both know\r\n\u2605 Choose \u201cAsk later\u201d if you\u2019re not sure about them, and we\u2019ll show them again tomorrow\r\n\r\n<b>SCRUFF EXPLORE</b>\r\n\u2605 Browse the top LGBTQ parties, prides, and festivals around the globe\r\n\u2605 RSVP, see who else is going, and find your squad\r\n\u2605 Traveling? Let others know when you'll be in their area and chat with local members before you arrive",
